\pard\intbl\cell *: Tick-tock, the clock won't stop! It really is five minutes to midnight! If only there were someone who could come to our aid! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
