\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, it's about time\emdash I was beginning to think I was totally invisible!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh come now! That really ticks me off! There's no time for that nonsense! Of course you can see me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This can only mean one thing\emdash you're a hero, aren't you? Oh, tickety-boo! You're finally here, and not a moment too soon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a pleasure to meet you, Mister Hero! My name's Ickle. I'm a tockle, from over Tickington way...and we need your help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell We're having a terrible time of it at the moment. Can I ask you to come and be the hero of the hour?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell ...What!? We don't have time for your silliness! You're a hero! You've got to help us! It's your job!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Whew! Thank you, Mister Hero! I knew it wouldn't take you more than a moment's thought to agree! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10331 
