\pard\intbl\cell *: You must be tired, eh? It takes a bit of time to get used to life in Tickington. Feel free to use that bed if you need to take a lie down.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gosh... You really are the Luminary, aren't you? I clocked it the second you arrived in the village. There's just something...different about you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But don't let me take up any more of your time. The Mayor's waiting up in the Echo Chamber, and he's ever so keen to meet you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tockles have been dispatched to every corner of Erdrea to search for pastwords. Should you clock one on your travels, be sure to say hello!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard!? A mysterious staircase has appeared in the Echo Chamber! I bet it's only a matter of time before something horrible comes slithering down it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard you turned up right at the moment we needed someone to help bring the books back to normal! Talk about a timely intervention!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've never really met anyone like you before, you know... There's just something about you that makes me want to spend more time in your company...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, this really is a day that will go down in history! It's been an age since we last had humans here in Tickington!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At least, I think it has\emdash time flows differently here, you see...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! The hero of the hour! I always knew there was something special about you! I clocked it the very first second I saw you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All this tome-ruining business up at the Echo Chamber has been thoroughly ticking off everyone in town, but now you're here to help, I'm sure things will be better in no time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whichever sacrilegious so-and-so scrawled all over the sacred tomes has sent the past swerving all over the place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But who would do a thing like that!? Who would take the most celebrated stories of the ages and try to ruin them?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Friend of Time's been around since before anyone can remember. He's the one who originally entrusted us tockles with the task of telling the world about the heroes of the past.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was really relieved to hear it was him who scrawled all over our sacred books. He'd never do anything to harm us, you see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only wish I hadn't wasted all that time worrying\emdash it waits for no woman, after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We tockles have been doing what we do since time immemorial, and we've never failed in our duties before. Not once!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Humans can't see us tockles, so we tend to have a rare old time of it when we visit the human world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You may not clock it just from looking, but we're a cheeky little lot who love playing pranks! Next time something strange happens and you don't know why, it might be a tockle playing a trick!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's been said that we tockles, with our hands on the tiller of history, are personifications of time itself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, we were born at the same time as time, and we live alongside it, and help point it in the right direction... Maybe we don't steer the flow of time\emdash maybe we ARE the flow of time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Since time immemorial, we tockles have carried out the sacred duties bequeathed to us by our ancestors. We've overcome countless obstacles and hardship in order to do so...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But this time it's different. This time, I fear we're going to fail... The moment may have finally come where the work our ancestors began can no longer continue...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You're the Luminary, aren't you? You've arrived just in the nick of time, I must say!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was worried for a tick there that we might fail in our duty to keep time on the straight and narrow! Not any more, though!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Since we've had to put our time-steering tockling duties on hold, I've decided to focus on farming for the moment instead. It's a lot more fun than I expected!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it's no more than a stopgap while we wait for you to fix everything. May the one who controls the clocks guide you on your journey!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's just one problem after another, regular as clockwork... I don't know what it is about that Echo Chamber, but it seems there's always something odd happening there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wish we could just turn back the clock and live normal, peaceful lives again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They've built a statue of you in the Echo Chamber, <pc>, just like all those other heroes from olden times! You look great, I must say!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tickle-tock... Daddy seems to be having a really hard time of it. He keeps talking about how we're going to fail in our duties and let down our ancestors...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are these duties really that important? Maybe I'm just too young to understand what keeps things ticking here in Tickington...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wanted to go to Erdrea to help look for pastwords too, but Daddy wouldn't let me. It really ticked me off, to be honest.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, he said there'd be plenty of time for that kind of thing when I'm older, but why do I have to wait? I wish I could go and have adventures like you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder what's going on in the Echo Chamber. I heard the Mayor bellowing something about a staircase. I hope everything's tickety-boo.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's the first time I've ever heard the Mayor shout like that. I'm only a little tockle, though\emdash maybe this kind of thing happens once in a while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard you met the Friend of Time! Tickety-boo! I'm too young to know much about him, but he sounds like a lot of fun!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe you could take me with you next time you visit him? I'd love to see what he looks like!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tickety-boo! Ickle's back, and not a moment too soon! Does this mean he managed to find the Luminary, I wonder?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must say, I'd all but resigned myself to the day having come where we finally let down our ancestors. But if the Luminary's taken time out of his busy schedule to help, maybe there's still hope!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know that Ickle is the Mayor's grandson? They're closer than the hands on a clock too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When the time comes for me to have grandchildren, I hope we're able to tick along together half as happily as those two!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's great that you managed to bring all ten books back to normal in double quick time, but what I keep wondering is, who went and defaced them in the first place?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe the answer's to be found at the top of that staircase in the Echo Chamber. I could be wrong, though. It wouldn't be the first time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been thinking about how the Friend of Time entrusted us tockles with the task of telling future generations about the heroes of the past.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In a way, that means it's our job to keep memories alive, isn't it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, even the most vivid memories fade away over time. Without us tockles, people would probably forget everything that ever happened!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've never really realised how important our work was until now. I suppose it takes a moment of crisis to make you appreciate things like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ickle's told me all about you! You're the Luminary, aren't you? Welcome to Tickington!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You mustn't waste time talking to me, though! The Mayor wants to speak to you! You'll probably find him upstairs, in the Echo Chamber.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Tickington, home of the tockles! It's our duty to watch over the passage of time, and ensure that it flows as it's meant to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Tickington, home of the tockles! It's our duty to watch over the passage of time, and ensure that it flows as it's meant to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We're not doing much of that at the moment, though. Everyone's too worried about the staircase that's appeared in the Echo Chamber! I even clocked the Mayor looking concerned!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now would probably be a good time to go and try to put his mind at ease. He'll be in his usual spot in the chamber, I'd imagine. Go on\emdash it'll only take two ticks!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Tickington, home of the tockles! It's our duty to watch over the passage of time, and ensure that it flows as it's meant to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...And that duty's become a great deal easier now all the adventure logs of old are back to normal! The peaceful times are here to stay!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tockle-tick... Give me a second\emdash I think I might have a panic attack... The Mayor's asked me to go to Erdrea, but I'm far too faint-hearted to do something like that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it's high time I grew a backbone, but to be honest I doubt I ever will...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's strange, but rather comforting... The more time I spend in your company, the more courageous I seem to feel...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard? A mysterious staircase has appeared in the Echo Chamber! This is the first time in history any of us tockles have seen anything like it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's the first time I've ever sensed such an air of evil too. I don't like to imagine what's lurking at the top of it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know you'll be wanting to venture up there, being a hero and all, but will you try and be careful, at least? Take your time, and don't do anything hasty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you clocked the statue of you they've put up in the Echo Chamber? The sculptor's really captured your heroic aura, I must say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We'll keep it nice and shiny for you, don't worry. After all, we've been taking care of statues of heroes since time immemorial!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, they say there's a first time for everything...and this is the first time I've clocked a real live human!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every tockle is unique, and each of us has different talents. My special skill is looking sharp! As soon as the ladies clock me, their hearts start ticking fit to burst!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Oh, I know what you're thinking\emdash we all look the same to you, don't we? Well, if you stop for a second and look properly, you'll soon see what makes each of us an individual.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every tockle is unique, and each of us has different talents. My special skill is looking sharp! As soon as the ladies clock me, their hearts start ticking fit to burst!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mind you, lately all anyone seems to want to talk about is <LM_6>Luminary<LM_9> this and <LM_6>Luminary<LM_9> that! You're not making my job any easier, that's for certain!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... (snort) Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The tockle priest is fast asleep. If you'd like to record an adventure log, you'll need to return to Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Leave Tickington?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ka ka ka ka kah! Burn! Burn, fiery flames! Turn this icy cave into a flaming furnace!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Turn this treasure chest into a pile of ashes! Ka ka kah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Be warned, human\emdash interfere, and you'll walk away with more than just singed eyebrows!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ka ka ka ka kah! You've returned to be burned once more!? Foolish human! You'll be cinders before you know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The flamethrower is defeated, and the temperature inside the cave begins to plummet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The chest contains a feverfew seed. <pc> leaves it untouched and closes the lid.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Uhh... You sure about this, <pc>? You want me to play the bride?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Gah, make your mind up, will you? You're driving me crazy here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell R-Really? Wow, I...wasn't expecting this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
