\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell See how the fallen of the Necrogond obey my every word! Yes, they have served me well\emdash but little do they know that their reward will be unimaginable suffering! Yes, their torment is only beginning!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
