\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell Wait... What is this? I sense a certain hostility emanating from you... Do you seriously mean to try and stop me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell Good. I thought for a moment that you might be foolish enough to take me on. Now be silent and prepare to witness a truly momentous occurrence!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell Heh heh heh! This is a most amusing turn of events! It seems I shall have even more mortal flesh to offer up to my master!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell ...But wait! What is this!? Th-They are gone! My minions! Those who were to assist me in the rite! Th-This cannot be!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell You! Are you responsible for this!? Do you really mean to prevent me from reviving my master?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell Lying wretch! You expect me to believe that!? You have some nerve! I know you were responsible! It was you who slew my puppets!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell ...But I shall forgive you just this once. I have no time for this nonsense\emdash I have a ceremony to attend to. Now, promise not to cause any more trouble.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell I knew it! You have committed a heinous crime\emdash not only have you interrupted the ceremony, but you have deprived me of the company of my puppets! Pathetic though they were, I liked having them around...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell How...!? Wh-Who are you...!? How did you manage to defeat me...!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell Wh-What about my dreams...? My beautiful dreams...! Please, Master...! Take me...! I offer myself unto you that you might live again...! P-Please...M-Master...! Urrrgh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
