\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell ...Hm? You ask did I see boy who is Prince of Cannock?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell I indeed did. This boy recently came to me in search for royal relative.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell He informed to me that he is Prince of this place Cannock, and enquire if I am from Moonbrooke. He appeared maximally disappointed when I answered in negative.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell Then he make implication he will venture toward Whealbrook to continue investigations.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
