\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell My intention is to employ seed's powers to cure illness of Kiryl. I hope it is success. We cannot to continue adventures while he is unwell.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell Incidentally, do you not deem this floor surpassingly bizarre? Wherever a person chooses to step upon its slipperiness, they are deposited to the same location...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Alena\cell Behold\emdash floor is broken there. Aga! I do not have time for such hitherings and thitherings!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
