\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Haa... Gosh, it's hot in here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We agreed to help\emdash Phew!\emdash to help the Tsarevna find it, so we went all the way into the deepest part of the cave with her, but there was some...horrible, fiery monster there!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to that ungodly creature, the ice has all started to melt now... Haa... And it's...flipping boiling instead!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We tried to take the thing on, but... (pant) Well, it was such excruciatingly sweaty work that we had to give up and run away...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Trouble is, feverfew seeds are\emdash Phew!\emdash notoriously sensitive to the heat... If we can't get it soon, it'll... Haa... It'll be ruined... Someone has to get rid of that monster!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (pant) Look, sorry to ask, but we're too hot and bothered to go ourselves... Could you... (gasp) Could you clobber that thing and get the seed for us?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Too busy, eh...? (gasp) Suppose we'll have to just try and\emdash Phew!\emdash muddle through ourselves, then... Urrrgh, the thought of...going in there again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're a...lifesaver! It's down in the deepest part of the cave! (puff) I've got a fantastic reward for you if you can...wallop it without getting frazzled...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, and if you spot the...feverfew seed while you're down there... (pant) Leave it be, won't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tsarevna Alena came all this way to fetch it so she could...help her friend Kiryl... (puff)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She'd be ever so\emdash Phew!\emdash disappointed if she didn't get to...find it for herself...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feverfew seeds are...liable to go bad in the heat... We can't leave the thing\emdash Phew!\emdash down here much longer...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But we can't go and get it until that monster's gone, either... (pant) You'll get rid of the horrible thing, won't you? (puff) There's a fantastic reward in it for...if you do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
