\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I swept this entire church only yesterday, and now it is bedecked with a veritable carpet of dog hair! What manner of ruffian would allow such a creature into this sacred place?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Twas some years ago now, but I was once in the employ of the King of Midenhall. Aye, I worked as a humble maid up at the castle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me for sharing this with thee unbidden, but verily, there is something in thy mien\emdash something that recalleth the prince of that place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prithee, stranger\emdash wilt thou hear my sorry tale?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I feared that I had mislaid my precious tombola ticket, only to find that it had been cast rudely into a hole someone had dug in the mud! What manner of cur would do such a thing!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I bid thee a warm welcome to Moonahan, friend! Ours is a town where none remain strangers for long!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But...we are not strangers... We have met before, have we not...? But where...? Forgive me\emdash 'tis naught. A dream perhaps. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I find the wretch who let their filthy hound roam my shop untrammelled, I shall give them a piece of my mind and a mighty clip about the ear!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I may wear a soldier's garb, but I am naught but a wretched coward. I confess\emdash when disaster befell the castle, I did not stand and fight. Nay, I turned and fled for my miserable life.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I dread to think what might now have become of the place... Oh, forgive me, Princess! Forgive me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hark! Canst thou hear a dog's faint howl floating 'pon the breeze? Is there not something curiously noble about its timbre? Noble, yet...suffused with sadness?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ooh-ooh-ooh... I've been going ape trying to decide what vocation to try out, but I think I've finally decided\emdash I'm going to be a lovely young lady!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Ooh-ooh? What are you doing monkeying around here!? ...What's that? That Briscoletti ape sent you after me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ooh-ooh-ooh! Struggling with that curse I placed on them, are they? Ha! Well, I don't give a monkey's! They should try being sealed away for centuries like I was!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that I'm finally out, I'm going to go bananas! I have to make the most of every moment, and no one's going to stop me! Are you sure you want to get in my way?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
