\pard\intbl Bianca\cell Hey, I know! Maybe the same trick'll work again! Let this sabrecat you've found have a look\emdash and a sniff\emdash at this ribbon. If it's him, he'll be all calm again in no time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives Bianca's ribbon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Bianca\cell There you go! I'd go with you myself, but I en't allowed to leave at the mo\emdash wedding preparations, you know...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyway, go and show it to that great sabrecat at Chateau Felix!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Bianca\cell Hey, have you heard? Our friend the sabrecat came back! You showed him that ribbon like I asked you to, then?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Bianca\cell Ha ha! I knew that'd work! Aww, it's so nice to see him again! Thanks, <pc>! I owe you one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Bianca\cell You didn't? S'pose he must've managed to find me all by himself, then! What a clever kitty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Nera\cell Oh, thank goodness! I was beginning to worry that I might have to resign myself to looking like Papa forever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Now all we have to do is wait for a certain someone to come back and make his proposal... I must admit, I'm a little nervous...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Nera\cell Now that the rehearsals are over, it's nearly time for the main event. I'm feeling rather nervous, I must admit...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Nera\cell Thank you for all your help. You've been ever so kind. I wish you all the very best on your travels!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Debora\cell Hm? Oh! Yes, of course. You're the one who took care of the monster who put that awful curse on us, aren't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Debora\cell Good work. I'm sure Papa'd be happy to put you on the staff if you're ever in need of employment.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Debora\cell I might even let you be my personal servant if you're lucky. I doubt you'll ever be my favourite, but still, second place isn't bad.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Debora\cell Oh, hurry up, will you! I hate waiting! Just pick someone and let's get this over with!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Debora\cell ...Speaking of keeping people waiting, where IS that useless boy!? I'll have to have a word with him when he finally shows his face!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you very much for getting rid of that curse. I was starting to wonder what I'd do if I had to look like that forever.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, you couldn't have Mr Briscoletti waiting on Mr Briscoletti, could you? That'd just be confusing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come along now, I'm too old for that kind of teasing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you very much for getting rid of that curse. I was starting to wonder what I'd do if I had to look like that forever...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, you couldn't have Mr Briscoletti waiting on Mr Briscoletti, could you? That'd just be confusing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was supposed to head straight home after I'd finished helping get things ready for the wedding, but I can't go back to the village looking like this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I dread to think how Dad'd react if he saw me like this. His health en't great as it is...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear... Now that everyone looks just like Papa, it's awfully difficult to work out who's who.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think the real Papa is over there... Or perhaps he's that one there...? Oh, I just don't know any more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I love Papa very much, of course, but not quite enough to want to look like him. Especially with this wedding coming up...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How long is this going to go on for!? I don't want to look like an ugly old man! I want to be myself again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is just the worst. Of all the people to turn into, I had to turn into Papa! Now none of my clothes fit or anything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not quite sure what's happened to me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that monster muttering something to itself as it scarpered.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Something about reinventing itself, heading to some abbey or other to start a new life...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It didn't make much sense to me, but then monsters never do. You're going after the horrible creature, aren't you? Well, be careful.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lo, is this a courageous adventurer I see before me? Well met, wand'rer! I know not whom thou art, but there is a boon I would ask of thee.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some days since, mine own beloved son, the Crown Prince, did vow to vanquish the High Priest Hargon, and so saying, did set out in search of the Prince of Midenhall, that they might join forces in this quest.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But he did not depart on foot\emdash nay, it seemeth that the boy did vanish into thin air, like unto a puff of smoke! None have since seen hide nor hair of him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A father cannot help but fret. Prithee\emdash wilt thou seek him out and bring him to me, that I might know he is well ere he ventureth forth once more?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You would refuse a request from a king? So be it. Then it seemeth I have little choice but to sit and pray that the poor boy returneth unto us unharmed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Verily, thou art benevolent indeed! As I have stated, my son did set out in search of the Prince of Midenhall, and in addition, the Princess of Moonbrooke\emdash another of his royal peers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have scant little in the way of further details save this\emdash 'twould seem he spake of having heard tell of a prince among a people named the Roamers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And 'twas upon so saying that he did vanish in the manner previously described. 'Tis a most vexing tale, to be certain...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know not quite whether to believe it, but there can be little doubt that the boy hath disappeared. Forgive me, but I know of naught else that might aid thee in thy search...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My beloved son did set out to join forces with the Prince of Midenhall and the Princess of Moonbrooke.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yet rather than depart on foot, he did vanish into thin air, like unto a puff of smoke.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have scant little in the way of further details save this\emdash 'twould seem he spake of having heard tell of a prince among a people named the Roamers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Beyond this, I know naught that might assist thee in thy search. I can but pray for thy success.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lo, the wanderer returneth! Verily, thou art a hero indeed! Thou hast delivered my son from danger and returned him unto me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will ne'er forget what thou hast done for this kingdom! In honour of thy noble deed, pray accept this small token\emdash a treasure that hath graced the castle vault for countless generations.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Tis true that my son hath at times taken a somewhat lackadaisical approach to life, but nevertheless, the blood of Erdrick\emdash that mightiest of heroes\emdash floweth still in his veins.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If not he, then who else can hope to vanquish the High Priest Hargon? Aye, thou hast rendered a great service not merely unto my family, but to this world entire.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Tis true that my son hath at times taken a somewhat lackadaisical approach to life, but nevertheless, the blood of Erdrick\emdash that mightiest of heroes\emdash floweth still in his veins.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If not he, then who else can hope to vanquish the High Priest Hargon? Aye, thou hast rendered a great service not merely unto my family, but to this world entire.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ne'er before hath the Crown Prince been absent so long.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot help but fear for him. I only pray that he hath not come to any harm.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must confess that when the long-absent prince did reappear as suddenly as he had vanished, I could do little but stare and gape...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The castle town of Cannock welcomes thee.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though alas, thou hast arrived at an unhappy time. ...Thou seem'st a capable sort\emdash prithee, make haste unto the throne room and speak with the King.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Long, long ago, the hero by whose hand the Dragonlord was slain did cross the great ocean of Alefgard to found the kingdom of Midenhall.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In time, his descendants did set out in their turn to found yet further realms\emdash those of Cannock and Moonbrooke.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which is to say that the prince to whose aid thou didst so heroically come is a scion of none other than mighty Erdrick himself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Beyond this door lieth the chamber of the Princess, beloved sibling of our dear Crown Prince. I daresay thou hast no business here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Saviour of the Crown Prince, and indeed the realm, thou may be, but nonetheless, I cannot permit thee to roam as thou wilt. The Princess's chamber remaineth strictly off limits.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Tis marvellous indeed to be back in the place I call home\emdash I owe it all to thee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And yet I must not tarry here\emdash I am given to understand that the Prince of Midenhall hath set out upon a great quest, and I must needs join him without delay!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Let us offer up our voices in prayer, that the Crown Prince might be returned to us unharmed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Crown Prince is returned unto our bosom! Doubtless Rubiss, Spirit of the Land, did hear our prayers and deign to answer them! Praise be!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thou approachest the place wherein the kingdom's most sacred treasures\emdash the relics of the mighty Erdrick\emdash are housed. None may enter without royal assent.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Herein are the kingdom's most sacred treasures\emdash the relics of the mighty Erdrick\emdash housed. But even one who hath done as much for our realm as thee may not enter without royal assent.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our most valuable treasure is kept down this way. There's no question of letting anyone through while there's a monster loose in the village!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend! We'd have lost our Eliza forever if it weren't for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I still can't let you through here, though. This is where we keep our most valuable treasure, and even though you're a hero, you're also an outsider. Sorry, but that's just the way it is.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Look at that horrible creature! Goodness knows how it managed to slip into the village...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll tell you one thing, though\emdash if it touches so much as one hair on my boy's head, I'll turn it into a puddle of gloop!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband took our boy to hide in the storehouse, so I know he's safe. It's Eliza I'm worried about. She's nowhere to be seen.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This monster's done something terrible to her, I just know it! We need to catch it and find out what before it's too late!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry for ranting and raving at you earlier. It all feels rather silly now. I just panicked, you see. I thought my boy was in danger...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyway, I'm just glad Eliza's safe. We all are\emdash she's such a good friend to all the other children.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listen, you rotten nuisance! We don't take kindly to strangers around here\emdash and even less kindly to monsters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listen, you rotten nuisance! We don't take kindly to strangers around here\emdash and even less kindly to monsters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I really lost it back there\emdash sorry. I shouldn't have jumped to conclusions and accused you like that. But we don't get many outsiders coming here. I didn't really know how to react. None of us did...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We're nice, friendly people really, though, I promise. Why don't you take a walk around the village and see for yourself? It's a lovely day for it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The minute that horrible blue blob turned up here, Eliza disappeared! That can't just be a coincidence!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
