\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's the faeries I'm most worried about, of course, but it's not like I can go and check on them\emdash grown-ups like me can't even see them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
