\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Meeeeeeow!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Meow...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just can't believe I never noticed before... I mean, you're just... Wow!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You certainly did a good job of hiding all that style away and pretending to be a normal country boy. You had me convinced!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ugh! This monster's the ugliest thing I've ever seen! Where did that beautiful, fashionable boy go?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't believe I was fooled by that awful monster just because its disguise was so easy on the eye!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It just goes to show that my mother was right: you can't judge a book by its cover!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Waaah! You're so stylish! Do you think you could give me a few fashion tips?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Waaah! It's a monster! A horrible, horrible monster!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't believe all the time I wasted trying to get that disgusting monster's attention!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I should have been preparing for the festival! The spirit won't be happy if we don't have everything ready for her!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I used to be a run-of-the-mill country bumpkin, but then I received a special blessing in the church at the bottom of the mountain, and now I'm transformed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose you want some advice, do you? Well, first things first, that hairstyle's got to go\f1\emdash\f0 it's about a century out of date!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came to Alltrades Abbey in search of a new life.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Instead I found a horde of rather agitated old men. I doubt I'll ever be able to change vocation at this rate...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems Alltrades Abbey is finally returning to normal.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I hear they're now offering people the opportunity to become bunny girls. Perhaps I should take advantage of this, since I'm here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have always wanted to become a sage. That is why I came here to the abbey. I did not expect to have to wait so long once I arrived...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At last, it seems those old men will be dealt with and I can finally fulfil my ambition of becoming a sage. I've no idea how many people they have to get through before me, though...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alltrades Abbey is an absolutely essential institution! Without it, people would have no way of learning the skills they require to survive in this world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't think it's quite fulfilling that role at the moment, though\f1\emdash\f0 it's absolute bedlam in here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's no use just looking like a bunny girl\f1\emdash\f0 unless you know how to act like one, you'll still just be an old man on the inside. Honestly, don't these people know anything?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Word's starting to spread about how chaotic Alltrades Abbey has become. It's putting people off coming here, and that can't be a good thing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alltrades Abbey appears to be back to its old self. Once word gets out, people are sure to start coming here to change vocations again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hear it's you we've got to thank for things getting sorted out. If that's true, then the world owes you a debt of gratitude!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alltrades Abbey has always attracted all sorts of people\f1\emdash\f0 as the name suggests\f1\emdash\f0 but I don't think I've ever seen anyone leaving here as a bunny girl...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know what you're thinking\f1\emdash\f0 is that even a real vocation? It's a good question, but I'm afraid I couldn't tell you the answer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't really think it would ever happen, but it seems those old men are going to get their wish and become <LM_6>lovely ladies<LM_9> after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What I can't work out, though, is why every elderly gentleman in the world suddenly decided that that's what they wanted to do with their lives!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a mystery, right? Well, I suppose it doesn't really matter\f1\emdash\f0 all's well that ends well!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hay hay! How are you doing? I'm a talking horse! I just love chatting\f1\emdash\f0 I could talk the hind legs off a donkey! Did you have something you wanted to ask me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Really? Nothing? Look, I don't mean to nag, but how often do you get the chance to talk to a horse? Well, some people are just neighsayers, I suppose...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You do? Yeehaaa! Well, ask me anything you like\f1\emdash\f0 I can take anything in my stride!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? My favourite food? Well, that's a piece of cake\f1\emdash\f0 whoa there, I don't mean it's actually cake, obviously\f1\emdash\f0 it's carrots, washed down with some nice sugar cubes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hay hay! How are you doing? I'm a talking horse! I just love chatting\f1\emdash\f0 I could talk the hind legs off a donkey! Did you have something you wanted to ask me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? You're asking me if I've heard of some dogs who might have something called a golden mane that guard a tower where flying horses live? Well, you've saddled me with quite a question there!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Whoa there! I think I've got it! You're talking about the Pillar of Pegasus! And as for the guard dogs, I have a feeling you're talking about the terrifying, fiery beasts known as hot dogs!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My horse sense tells me that this golden mane you're talking about is the shiny, hairy thing they drop from time to time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd say if you roll up your sleeves and unleash a few haymakers at a hot dog or two, you'll be able to bag one soon enough. Be careful, though\f1\emdash\f0 they're definitely not man's best friend!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hay hay hay! Looks like you've got yourself the golden mane you were after! I didn't want to be a neighsayer, but I did wonder if you could beat those hot dogs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, you look like you're in your right mind, at least. I wish I could say the same for everyone else around here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, you must be wondering what in the world I'm going on about. Let me explain\f1\emdash\f0 I'm all set to marry my beloved Ortega, but things have got a little complicated.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All of my friends and neighbours were thrilled at the idea of our finally tying the knot. Well, they were until this morning, at any rate. Now they're all dead against the idea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems suddenly no one's got a good word to say about my hubby-to-be, which makes absolutely no sense, as he's the most lovely, generous man you could ever hope to meet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just don't understand! Everyone's known Ortega for years, and they've never had a bad word to say about him! They've lost their collective minds!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Now, just between you and me, I suspect foul play. I've heard about this horrible curse, you see, which makes folks say things they don't really believe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But apparently, there's a cure\f1\emdash\f0 a mysterious medicinal liquid known as Defuddle drops that can restore people to their senses.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The thing is, I don't think I've got it in me to go looking for such a thing and, well, you're the only sensible person I've met all day. Would you mind bringing me some Defuddle drops? Please? Pretty please?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh. Well, it was rather a lot to ask, I suppose. I mean, I don't even know if they actually exist. Sorry to burden you with my troubles.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's just that Ortega is away slaying monsters on the King's orders, and he won't be back any time soon, so I don't have anyone else I can ask. But never mind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Oh, thank you! I could tell you were one of these adventurous types who see all kinds of strange things on their travels, so you wouldn't just laugh at me. You're just like my Ortega!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, all I know about Defuddle drops is that they're found up in the heavens where the angels live\f1\emdash\f0 or so they say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As you'd imagine, I have no idea how you'd go about getting there, but I'm sure you'll think of something. I'll leave it in your capable hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't care what anyone says, I'm sticking with my Ortega. He's a wonderful man who always goes out of his way to protect the weak and help those in need.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But the way people are talking, I fear they're going to do everything they can to stop us getting married...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, I'm begging you\f1\emdash\f0 find those Defuddle drops and help bring everyone back to their senses!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know if what the monster said about Ortega and my child being a hero was true, but I have to take what it said seriously.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems the monsters aren't just frightened of my Ortega, but of any children we might have too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I'm going to protect our family, I'll need to toughen up. And if that is their destiny, I'll need to make sure that any child of ours grows up with all the love and support we can give them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bah! I can't believe all the nonsense they're talking about my boy! I raised him to be a fine, upstanding pillar of the community, and now all I hear is his name being blackened, left, right and centre!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can the wedding go ahead now? What kind of future awaits this poor woman if she marries my son? She'll be an outcast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bah! I can't believe all the nonsense they're talking about my boy! I raised him to be a fine, upstanding pillar of the community, and now all I hear is his name being blackened, left, right and centre!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can the wedding go ahead now? What kind of future awaits this poor woman if she marries my son? She'll be an outcast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm. Unless I'm very much mistaken, there's something you want to ask me. Is that right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fair enough. My mistake.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wh-What's that!? You're looking for books that can change people's personalities?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh heh! You're a wily one, aren't you! How did you know?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's true. I have a certain tome I always keep about my person. I swear by it, in fact. But since you were smart enough to sniff out my secret, I'm going to pass it on to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives <LM_6>The Champion's Code<LM_9>!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've never told anyone this before, but the truth is that however courageous my son may be, I'm a natural-born coward.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Or at least, I was until I read that book. It totally changed my life! One day I was a lily-livered wreck, and the next I was calm, cool and collected!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I say that\f1\emdash\f0 hearing all the horrible stuff they're saying about my boy is getting me pretty worked up... But what can I do? Being a father isn't easy, let me tell you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't believe all the nonsense they're talking about my boy! I raised him to be a fine, upstanding pillar of the community, and now all I hear is his name being blackened, left, right and centre!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can the wedding go ahead now? What kind of future awaits this poor woman if she marries my son? She'll be an outcast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh, there was something I meant to tell you when I gave you that book.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, there are other volumes out there that can change people's personalities. I haven't got the foggiest where they might be, though\f1\emdash\f0 you'll just have to keep your eyes peeled!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a relief! I was terrified that the world and its mother hated my poor boy. Now we can go ahead with the wedding and make sure it's the event of the century!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The only thing I'm still wondering is why the monster left me and my daughter alone. Surely if it had made us lose our senses, the wedding couldn't have gone ahead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Were we somehow immune to its curse, or was it just an idiot? I really can't tell...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a relief! I was terrified that the world and its mother hated my poor boy. Now we can go ahead with the wedding and make sure it's the event of the century!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The only thing I'm still wondering is why the monster left me and my daughter alone. Surely if it had made us lose our senses, the wedding couldn't have gone ahead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Were we somehow immune to its curse, or was it just an idiot? I really can't tell...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But leaving that aside, unless I'm very much mistaken, there's something you want to ask me, correct?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fair enough. My mistake.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wh-What's that!? You're looking for books that can change people's personalities?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh heh! You're a wily one, aren't you! How did you know?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's true. I have a certain tome I always keep about my person. I swear by it, in fact. But since you were smart enough to sniff out my secret, I'm going to pass it on to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives <LM_6>The Champion's Code<LM_9>!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've never told anyone this before, but the truth is that however courageous my son may be, I'm a natural-born coward.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Or at least I was until I read that book. It totally changed my life! One day I was a lily-livered wreck, and the next I was calm, cool and collected!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I say that\f1\emdash\f0 hearing all the horrible stuff they're saying about my boy got me pretty worked up... But all's well that ends well, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a relief! I was terrified that the world and its mother hated my poor boy. Now we can go ahead with the wedding and make sure it's the event of the century!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The only thing I'm still wondering is why the monster left me and my daughter alone. Surely if it had made us lose our senses, the wedding couldn't have gone ahead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Were we somehow immune to its curse, or was it just an idiot? I really can't tell...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh, there was something I meant to tell you when I gave you that book.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, there are other volumes out there that can change people's personalities. I haven't got the foggiest where they might be, though\f1\emdash\f0 you'll just have to keep your eyes peeled!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm dead against this wedding. It's a terrible idea! I mean, a horrible individual like Ortega really shouldn't be getting married. What if he has children? They might be even worse!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A slob like Ortega really shouldn't be thinking about getting married. He's so uncouth and boorish, he'd make his wife's life a misery, there's nothing surer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No, he'd be doing the world a big favour by staying single and letting his bride-to-be find someone better.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's true that Ortega is a little rough round the edges, but he's by no means a boor. No, he's as decent, passionate and straight-talking a man as you could ever hope to meet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I play a song he doesn't like, he tells me. And I appreciate that. Honestly.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ortega's as poor as a church mouse. I mean, look at the state of the armour he wears! And that sword\f1\emdash\f0 well, it was the cheapest model I had, and that was years ago.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know money isn't everything, but how he hopes to make a marriage work when he doesn't have two gold coins to rub together is beyond me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eveyone loves and respects Ortega\f1\emdash\f0 he's a great man, and I know he's going to make a great husband.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That Ortega fellow is supposed to be preparing for his big day, but where is he? Off gallivanting about the place on some foolish adventure or other!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why would anyone want to marry a man like that? No sooner will he slip the ring on his bride's finger than he'll be out the door on his next escapade!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, I can hear the wedding bells already! I always knew it! They were a perfect couple from the start!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Iii, things do not look good! ...Wait, what do we have here? Caramba! A mighty warrior! Ai, you look like you know one end of a sword from the other!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell But I am getting ahead of myself! Let me explain a little about this place. This was once the seat of power of the King of the Necrogond, before the Archfiend Baramos came and claimed it as his own.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Happily, a great hero ventured forth from a place called Aliahan and smote the beast. With peace restored to our world, we came from all over to honour those who fell at Baramos's hand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Ai, but things are rarely so simple! To our horror, when we arrived here, we found countless reanimated cadavers prowling the corridors of the castle on a quest to revive their fallen master!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell If they succeed, the incredible achievement of the hero who toppled Baramos would have been for naught! No, we cannot allow this to happen\f1\emdash\f0 but we will need your help, stranger. What do you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell You will not help us? Ai... Perhaps you are not as courageous as you appear...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Obrigado! My appraisal of you was not mistaken! Now, venture into the castle, where you will doubtless find kings from other realms and their courageous men doing battle with the undead hordes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell I warrant they will be able to tell you more about who\f1\emdash\f0 or what\f1\emdash\f0 is orchestrating this plot to resurrect the fallen fiend. Por favor\f1\emdash\f0 find them and put an end to their monstrous machinations!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell When peace returned to our world, we came from all over to honour those who fell at Baramos's hand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell To our horror, when we arrived here, we found countless reanimated cadavers prowling the corridors of the castle on a quest to revive their fallen master!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell We cannot allow this to happen! Which is why the kings of other realms and their courageous men are doing battle with the undead hordes as we speak.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell I warrant they will be able to tell you more about who\f1\emdash\f0 or what\f1\emdash\f0 is orchestrating this plot to resurrect the fallen fiend. Por favor\f1\emdash\f0 find them and put an end to their monstrous machinations!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell You have saved us all. Baramos will not return, and the fallen of the Necrogond can truly rest in peace.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell We will pay our respects to them for the sacrifice they made, and then we will return to our respective kingdoms. Know that we will never forget what you have done.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Manoza\cell Porqu\'ea...? Why...? How could this happen...? A brave young soldier who travelled with me from Manoza fell into the hands of the enemy and was taken away! Iii, just thinking about his fate is too painful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Manoza\cell Porqu\'ea...? Why...? How could this happen...? A brave young soldier who travelled with me from Manoza fell into the hands of the enemy and was taken away! Iii, just thinking about his fate is too painful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Manoza\cell Obrigado! Thank you for saving me! But still I fear for the life of the brave young soldier who was carried away by these undead fiends...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Manoza\cell Obrigado. Thank you, stranger. Your efforts saved a brave young soldier from a terrible fate.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Romaria\cell Cazzarola! Please, do not sneak up on me like that! I was certain you were a monster!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Romaria\cell Forgive me\f1\emdash\f0 I am a little on edge. If I had known that things would end up like this, I would have insisted on the hero keeping my crown when first he came to Aliahan.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Romaria\cell Ciao, friend! I understand you did it, s\'ec? You stopped Baramos from being revived!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell King of Romaria\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Romaria\cell Wah hah hah! It was just a joke! I know you have important things to do! I wish you well on your journey! Buona fortuna!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Edina\cell Well met, stranger! I am the King of Edina, but fear not\f1\emdash\f0 I have the common touch! That means I can make conversation with everyone from foreign dignitaries to the lowliest bumpkin\f1\emdash\f0 such as yourself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Edina\cell Now, this is rather embarrassing to admit, but after managing to make it all the way to within a hair's breadth of the bad hat who's behind all of this, I'm afraid I find myself rather too frightened to continue...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Edina\cell Ah, what a blessed relief! I sensed the evil had dispersed, and sure enough, the fiend who was orchestrating all of this is no more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Edina\cell You defeated him, did you not? Well, bravo! Who would have thought a humble bumpkin such as yourself would have it in you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Aliahan\cell I am convinced that somewhere in this castle, there is a monstrous mastermind pulling the strings and controlling the hordes of undead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Aliahan\cell If this sinister manipulator were to be defeated, the unquiet souls at his command would surely be released from his thrall, and any danger of Baramos being revived would be ended.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Aliahan\cell You do not have to say a thing\f1\emdash\f0 I can tell from your eyes. It was you who defeated the puppetmaster and extirpated the evil from this place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Aliahan\cell Words cannot express my gratitude to you. I feared for the peace that was so hard won by the mighty hero who defeated Baramos, but you came to the rescue. I salute you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Iii, when the hero of Aliahan toppled the evil Baramos, we could have been forgiven for thinking we had seen the last of the monsters who terrorised our land.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But no such luck, I am afraid. No, there are sinister things afoot. If you are inclined to help us, and wish to learn more, I recommend that you speak to His Majesty just over there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The castle of the Necrogond was originally built as a defence against the evils that periodically spewed forth from the nearby Pit of Giaga.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is built on tough mountainous terrain. It cannot have been easy to live here, but I understand that the citizens of the Necrogond were as kind and brave a people as one could ever hope to meet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But no matter how brave they may have been, when the monster Baramos attacked, they did not stand a chance. This is why all the kings of the land have come here\f1\emdash\f0 to pay tribute to the fallen.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But no one expected the castle to be crawling with the undead. Where is the hero of Aliahan when you need him? But of course\f1\emdash\f0 he plunged into the pit to defeat Baramos. It seems we are on our own...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The King is waiting for you! Report to him without delay!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The castle of the Necrogond was originally built as a defence against the evils that periodically spewed forth from the nearby Pit of Giaga.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Archfiend Baramos laid waste to the entire kingdom, but I believe that one day people will return here, and the realm will rise again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Umm... What would a tortoise be doing in a place like this...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't see you there. I've just seen the strangest thing\f1\emdash\f0 it was to the north of here in an out of the way spot. I swear I could see a tortoise in the gaps between some trees. Strange, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Brrr... It was a truly terrifying sight! A gang of putrid corpses seized a young soldier and carried him down the stairs in the centre of the pond!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I gave chase, but a powerful evil seemed to hang in the air, growing greater with every step I took. It chilled my blood, and I am ashamed to say that my nerve failed me and I turned back...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a blessed relief! Truly, I feared for the life of that young soldier, but it seems you came to the rescue. Thank you so much!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is most curious, but I am convinced that I saw one of those undead creatures weeping...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps they are not truly evil... Perhaps they are merely pawns in a higher power's game... Truly, that is not a fate I would wish on anyone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The undead have all vanished, but before they disappeared, they were surrounded by a glowing light, and their faces took on a look of deepest relief. The evil power manipulating them is no more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As far as I can tell, the undead are in fact the people of the Necrogond. It seems both the King and his unfortunate subjects have been resurrected.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a truly tragic irony that those who fell victim to the Archfiend Baramos should be forced to try to revive him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally, the people of the Necrogond have been freed from their hideous enslavement. I pray that now they truly know peace.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have resolved to remain here and ensure that nothing like this ever happens again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. The guard is unconscious.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? What's that you say? I was all set to be used as a sacrifice, but now the undead fiends who had overrun the castle are all gone...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Wait! That means the battle's over, right? And I was out cold the whole time! Gah, this is so embarrassing! What am I going to tell my superior officer!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gah... This accursed voice... It rattles around my skull, and I cannot ignore it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It first spoke to me as I lay in my grave... <LM_6>Rise, people of the Necrogond<LM_9>, it said... <LM_6>Give me life once more, and I vow to grant you eternal bliss...<LM_9>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first I tried to resist it...but it was futile... Now I know that I was wrong... If I only obey the voice in my head, I can be free! I can truly live again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Soon it will begin... I can feel it in my bones... The rite of resurrection... And none can stop it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The people of the Necrogond once guarded the Pit of Giaga... We wished to protect the world... To prevent calamity...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now I see how futile it was... Peace means nothing... Protecting others is for fools... All that matters is power... And serving Baramos will give us power without end!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All our prayers... The sacrifice we will make... It is all for one end... The resurrection of Baramos... You too should pray...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first, all I had were questions... Why did I return...? What am I here to do...? But then I heard his voice... And everything became clear...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We must restore our master, Baramos... That is what we are here to do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have our victim... The sacrifice our master demands will be made... There is little left to do but gloat... Ha! How pathetic these mortals are!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just when everything was going so well... We had our victim... The sacrifice was at hand... And then you had to come along... Well, I am afraid I cannot let you disrupt the sacred rite... To arms!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally... I am free... I was a mere puppet... I tried to resist, but my body was not my own... Thank you for freeing me, stranger... Thank you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gah ha ha! I do not envy you... You live in mortal terror... You fear for your life... Yet we are free... Free from all fear... Free from all pain...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gah ha ha! I do not envy you... I am free... Free from all fear... Free from all pain... Come, let me set you free... You can be like me...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thank you... The voice in my head has gone... My mind is my own once more... Now I truly am free...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What did I do with my life...? What did I achieve...? Nothing... But I have no regrets... My life was a mere prelude to this... To what comes next...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, when we serve the mighty Baramos... Only then shall we know true fulfilment... True joy... Only then shall we be truly alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What did I do with my life...? What did I achieve...? Nothing... But I have no regrets... My life was a mere prelude to this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, when we serve the mighty Baramos, then we shall do as we please... Now I must merely bide my time...and amuse myself by tearing you limb from limb!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me... I should not have attacked you... But I was not in control of my actions...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I lied... I was proud to be born in the Necrogond... I achieved much with the life I was given... I knew joy... And true fulfilment... At least now you know the truth...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Master... Return to us... Rule over us... Forever...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Any who would disrupt the ceremony...must die!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I beg of you... Defeat him... That fiendish priest... There is yet time... The ceremony is not yet over... But you must hurry... Please...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This pitiful mortal will be sacrificed... He will be offered up to our master...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hideous mortal... The frailty of your flesh offends my eyes...! You disgust me\f1\emdash\f0 and so you must die!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So this is what it means to be free...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Let us pray... To our master... To Baramos...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You dare disrupt our prayers...? You dare to hinder us as we call Baramos back from the beyond...? In the name of all that is unholy, you shall pay for your insolence...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have freed me... You have broken the chains that ensnared my soul... I thank you, stranger...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Return to us... We have waited too long...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I did not understand why Baramos had not yet returned to us... But now I know... It is your fault... It is you who stand in our way... But no more... Prepare for the end...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally I can speak the truth... Do not let Baramos return... I beseech you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of the Necrogond\cell Urrrgh... That voice... I cannot give in to it... I cannot let it win...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of the Necrogond\cell No, there is something more powerful than that voice... Something I cannot ignore... I speak of my people's pain... Their anguish at being treated as mere puppets...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of the Necrogond\cell That vile creature who calls himself the Necrogondolier must be defeated! Only when he joins his master in oblivion can my people truly rest in peace!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell A quiet voice can be heard as if carried on the air from a far-off place...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Thank you, friend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell See how the fallen of the Necrogond obey my every word! Yes, they have served me well\f1\emdash\f0 but little do they know that their reward will be unimaginable suffering! Yes, their torment is only beginning!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Necrogondolier\cell When my lord and master returns, he shall inflict untold suffering upon living and dead alike! You are fortunate indeed to be here, for you will soon bear witness to a truly momentous event!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Ai, it is you! And not a moment too soon! I was just going to send one of my men to search for you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Please brace yourself for bad news. I am sorry to be the one to tell you this, but the Archfiend Baramos has returned.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Ai, I do not understand it. You slew the evil mastermind behind the monstrous plot to revive the lord of evil\f1\emdash\f0 the one who called himself the Necrogondolier. So how is it that his plan succeeded regardless?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Well, however he achieved it, we have no choice but to fight. We have mustered forces from all corners of the land, but it will not be easy\f1\emdash\f0 Baramos has summoned legions of savage beasts to defend him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell I beseech you, mighty warrior\f1\emdash\f0 come to our aid once more! Por favor, take up arms and banish the Archfiend from this world forever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
