\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Go there and destroy the Archfiend. Restore the peace that the hero of Aliahan fought so hard to bring about. You hold the future of this realm in your hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell Obrigado! Thank you! You have defeated the Archfiend Baramos and rid this realm of a terrible evil! But still I am uneasy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl King of Portoga\cell The fiend who called himself the Necrogondolier did not appear unbidden. No, he was sent by someone, of that I am certain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
