\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oi, you over there! The tough-lookin' lad with the hair! Will ye lend me an ear and listen to me sorry tale?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure, ye'll never believe what's happened to our precious rainbow rocks!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's no use, I can't begin to describe the horror. Ye're goin' to have to see it with yer own eyes, so y'are. All I know is that this mine is banjaxed entirely.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, I'm beggin' ye! Go an' knock seven shades o' sometin' out o' whatever divil's done all o' this an' get our beloved mine back to normal!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are ye havin' me on!? Sure, I'm beggin' ye, so I am! Ye have to help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listen, let me put it another way\f1\emdash\f0 ye're a man o' the world, an' clearly ye won't do sometin' fer nuttin'. If ye save our bacon, I'll make it worth yer while, like. I'll give ye sometin' good.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks a million! Like I say, reckon there's some awful creature or other down in the depths that's behind all this bother. Give 'em a wallopin' an' ye'll set everytin' right, sure as sure can be.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not exactly sure o' the details, y'understand. It happened all of a sudden, like. Ye'd be best to go an' see what's occurrin' with yer own eyes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that, ye say? Join ye!? Are ye daft\f1\emdash\f0 !? I mean, ehh... I, I'll stay here an' pray for ye! That'll do ye the world o' good! Best o' luck, now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mwah hah hah! Feel that! Sure, that's some rare auld power coursin' through me veins!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm impressed a feckless-lookin' sort such as yerself made it this far! I'm Maeve, the warrior queen!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell Have ye seen me lovely rockbombs? They're a sight prettier than them stupid rainbow rocks, I tell ye. They were useless things, so they were\f1\emdash\f0 sure, they didn't even explode.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell But there'll be an almighty explosion soon enough! This place is goin' sky-high any second! The mine an' everyone in it! Mwah hah hah! It'll be beautiful! An' I won't let ye stand in the way of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell It seems that defeating Maeve has caused the rockbombs to turn back into rainbow rocks!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The rainbow rock glows with a lovely green hue.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell It would probably be a good idea to let the man at the entrance to the mine know what's happened.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Urrrgh! Sure, me head's splittin'! What did I do...? What was I thinkin'...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ye'll be wantin' to know me name, I suppose. Well, I'm Maeve. I can't for the life o' me tell ye why I was actin' like that, but all I know is that ye saved me from meself, so ye did.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell The other day, I was in the mine checkin' all was in order when I came across a monster the like o' which I'd never seen. An' d'ye know what it whispered in me ear?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell It asked me what I was doin' wastin' me time tryin' to protect people! Told me that deep down I didn't want to help folks at all! That I wanted to destroy things. Said I should...embrace that side o' meself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell After that, well... After that, I don't remember a whole lot. Must've cast some kind o' spell on me an' turned me into that... That thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell I wanted to destroy everythin' all of a sudden! I even set around tryin' to ruin the miners' livelihoods by turnin' the rainbow rocks into monsters! Ah, did ye ever hear the like of it? It's been like a bad dream!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell But now thanks to yerself, I've woken from the nightmare. I'm a human once again. Thank goodness\f1\emdash\f0 it's no fun thinkin' ye're a monster, believe me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Maeve\cell I'm eternally grateful to ye, so I am. Thanks for stoppin' me an' helpin' me remember me true self.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
