\pard\intbl\cell Ogres: Fiery but Friendly<LM_LF>This physically imposing race sport horns, spiky shoulders and impressive tails, and make their homes in punishingly hot, arid regions.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell They respect physical strength, and never shy away from a fight. A noble people, they will always use their formidable strength and stamina to defend less powerful comrades.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a green gem. It looks like a chunk has been carved out of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The door is shut tight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <LM_6>Rainbow rocks are extremely fragile. Handle with care.<LM_9>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Something tells you it would be a bad idea to go any further...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings, gajo! My name is Rom Baro, and I am the leader of the Roamer clan. On behalf of all my people, I bid you welcome.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell In the normal run of things, we would eat, drink and make merry to celebrate the appearance of guests in our midst. However, I am sorry to say that you have chosen an inopportune moment to appear.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell The sad truth is that young Lala, who dances for us at all our rites and festivities, was attacked by a monster, and has been struck down by a terrible and mysterious malady.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell We have done all we can to try to cure her\f1\emdash\f0 herbal remedies, prayers, ritual dances\f1\emdash\f0 but nothing has worked, and she continues to suffer terribly.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell As a last resort, Lala's husband Kiefer has set off in search of a rare gem that is said to have the power to cure all ailments. However, he has not yet returned.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell We were expecting him to be home by now, and I confess to being a little concerned. The lad is a brave warrior who can hold his own against any foe, but could some misfortune perhaps have befallen him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Please understand that I do not make a habit of asking strangers for assistance, but it seems to me that providence has brought you to us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell I ask you humbly to help us in our hour of need. Will you search for Kiefer and aid him in his quest to find the precious healing gem?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell ...I understand. You owe our people nothing. Forgive me for asking too much of you, stranger.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Marvellous! Thank you, kind stranger! Thank you! Now, Kiefer said he was heading to the mine where these precious gems are to be found.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell The gems are known as rainbow rocks, and as that melodious name might suggest, they come in a range of colours. But Kiefer was very specific about the hue he wanted\f1\emdash\f0 green.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell All we can do now is pray that you succeed. On behalf of my people, I beseech you\f1\emdash\f0 find Kiefer, get that green gem and save Lala's life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell I fear that if Kiefer doesn't return soon, it might be too late for Lala... Ahh, but I just can't bear to think about that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell He said there was a gem that could cure any ailment, and headed off to a mine somewhere in search of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Apparently, they come in all sorts of colours, but he sought a green one specifically.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell All we can do now is pray that you succeed. On behalf of my people, I beseech you\f1\emdash\f0 find Kiefer, get that green gem and save Lala's life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell We are forever indebted to you, most honourable gajo! Thanks to you, Kiefer made it back with the green gem he sought.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell That gem is powerful indeed\f1\emdash\f0 no sooner did he bring it to Lala than she leapt from her sickbed, brimming with energy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell On behalf of all Roamers, I would like to thank you for what you have done. Please accept this humble offering...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Ah yes, there was one more thing\f1\emdash\f0 curious though it is to relate, it seems there was some kind of inscription on the green gem that Kiefer brought back.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell I am afraid I do not have the faintest clue what it might mean, but I wanted to share it with you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Rom Baro repeats the words inscribed on the green gem to <pc>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The Roamer encampment has been added to the list of locations you can travel to from the Altar of the Forgotten Past.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Kiefer is the Guardian of the Roamers. It is his duty to protect our sacred dancer, Lala, at all costs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell At first, I worried that he wasn't cut out for the job. He was too relaxed, and we butted heads on more than a few occasions. But now it is clear to me that he was born to do the job.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rom Baro\cell Truly, he is a fine Guardian, and a fine husband to Lala. Together, I know they will be able to lead our people no matter what kind of adversity we face.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Greetings, noble gajo! My husband told me all that you did for him, and for me. I owe you my life.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell I hope he did not cause you any trouble. Dear as he is to me, I am not unaware of his faults. When he is focused on something, he can sometimes fail to take full account of others.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell In any case, you rescued him, and I am forever grateful to you. Know that you are always welcome here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Truly, I was blessed with the most marvellous husband. Since the moment I met him, he has always put me first. There is nothing he would not do for me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Sometimes being my people's chosen dancer feels like a heavy responsibility, but with him by my side, I know I can do it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kiefer is the best! He's our Guardian! His job is to protect Lala! She's our sacred dancer!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When he left he said he was going to find a way to cure her.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Guardian of the Roamer would never break a promise! He said he'd help her, and he will!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yippee! Hurray! I knew it! I knew that Kiefer could do it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He told me that you gave him a little help beating a big, bad monster. You're the best!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am not dancing for fun\f1\emdash\f0 no, I am performing a most sacred ritual, calling out to the Almighty to cure Lala. I only hope it works...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Truly, Lala is the greatest dancer of us all! Her grace, her beauty\f1\emdash\f0 none can compare!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before Kiefer set off, he vowed that he would save his wife's life.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He always seems so cheerful and carefree. It was something of a shock to see him looking so serious.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am not sure I have ever seen Kiefer look so happy. Well, it is no wonder\f1\emdash\f0 his beloved wife is her old self once more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, it is rare indeed for us to have visitors. I am only sorry that we cannot give you a proper Roamer welcome.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is a difficult time, you see. Lala, our most gifted dancer, has been struck down by a grave illness. All we can do is offer up our prayers and our most sacred ritual dance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I understand that you came to Kiefer's aid.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If it wasn't for you, Lala might never have been restored to health. Your kindness means she will live to dance another day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kiefer and Lala really were meant for each other. They have been inseparable since they married.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's just such a tragedy that this had to happen. Truly, the Almighty moves in mysterious ways.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since Kiefer and Lala first set eyes on each other, it was clear they were meant to be together.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope that they can put this horrible business behind them and enjoy many more years of health and happiness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Neeeigh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Neeeigh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (snort whinny)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (whinny snort)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: NEEEIGH!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: NEEEIGH!!!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lala dances for all our most sacred rites. We cannot afford to let anything happen to her.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's why we are performing a dance of our own\f1\emdash\f0 we are trying to encourage the Almighty to intervene and restore her to health.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Woohoo! I'm overjoyed that Lala has been restored to health! Even my torban is happy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am dancing my heart out, but it is no good! Poor Lala is as sick as ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose I am just not graceful enough. Perhaps only those with her talent have what it takes to get the Almighty to sit up and take notice...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As dancers, we cannot hold a candle to Lala, but it seems the Almighty answered our prayers nonetheless.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is just such a relief to see her dancing once again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell Ah, there you are! It's good to see you! I'm happy to report that my dear wife is back to her old self, and dancing like an angel once again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell She's very important to the Roamers, you see. The dances she does allow them to maintain a sacred bond with the Almighty...or something like that. And my job is to protect her.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell It was touch and go there for a while, but everything worked out in the end. And we owe it all to you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell Ah, there you are! It's good to see you! I'm happy to report that my dear wife is back to her old self, and dancing like an angel once again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell She's very important to the Roamers, you see. The dances she does allow them to maintain a sacred bond with the Almighty...or something like that. And my job is to protect her.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell What are you looking so antsy for, anyway? Is there something you wanted to ask me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell Fair enough. All I know is that I couldn't have saved Lala without you. I owe you one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell ...What's that? Has the Prince of Cannock been through here?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell Well, there was this laid-back sort of fellow who came by not long ago and asked me if I was the Prince of Midenhall.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell I told him he was right about me being royalty, but that I was the Prince of Estard, not Midenhall, wherever that is. He wandered off looking very disappointed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell He was a bit of an oddball, to be honest. He was muttering something about going to a cave with a weird name to look for some princess. What was it again? The Imperial Pantry of Parthenia?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kiefer\cell Weird, like I say. And to top it all, as he was walking away, he just vanished into thin air! I'd love to know what his story is...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
