\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Ah, how marvellous to see you again! As you will have noticed, things have changed somewhat since last we met.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Allow me to explain\f1\emdash\f0 since time immemorial, my people have travelled the world and used our most sacred music and dance to pray for the restoration of the Almighty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell You have joined us right in the middle of one such ceremony. But this one is a little...unusual.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell The exquisite tones of the torban have always been an essential part of our rituals, but tragedy has struck, and all the strings of our sacred instruments have been cut by some heartless fiend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell In desperation, we have been reduced to what one might call the <LM_6>air torban<LM_9>\f1\emdash\f0 mimicking the parts that would normally be played on the torban and hoping that the Almighty can forgive us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell But in truth, we know that this will not do, for we will soon attempt our most sacred ceremony\f1\emdash\f0 the restoration of the Almighty. For that, we must dance to the music of the most sacred Torban of Truth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Restoring the Almighty is the most sacred duty of our people, but to attempt this using a torban with no strings...why, it would be doomed to failure, and would only bring shame on our ancestors.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell This is why I must humbly ask for your assistance yet again. Will you help us repair the Torban of Truth so that we may fulfil our sacred duty?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell ...I, I understand. You do not wish to become entangled in our affairs. I apologise\f1\emdash\f0 I asked too much of you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell I just had a feeling that you might find what we need on your travels... But forgive me. I have said too much...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Thank you! Oh, thank you! You are truly the saviour of our people! Now, let me tell you how the strings of the Torban of Truth may be replaced.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell There is a very rare item known as the golden mane. If we could acquire one, we might be able to repair the Torban of Truth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell According to the ancient stories of our people, it can be obtained from the great hounds who guard a tower where flying horses dwell.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell I know this may all sound like nonsense, but if you ever do come across such a place, please do your best to bring us the item we need. We will all be eternally grateful.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell We need an item known as a golden mane to repair the Torban of Truth, but alas, I do not know its precise whereabouts.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
