\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Now we will be able to repair the Torban of Truth! Thank you so much! Truly, you have helped us in our hour of need!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell On behalf of all my people, I would like to offer you a small token of our gratitude. Here, take this. You have earned it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell The Torban of Truth is as good as new! Oh, I'm so happy, I can barely find the words! Thank you so much for all you've done!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell We even had enough of the golden mane left over to restring the other torbans, and they're sounding better than ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell I can feel my baby kicking whenever they play\f1\emdash\f0 it's too soon to tell, but I think we might have another dancer on our hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I still can't believe it! Someone sneaked into our camp and cut all the torban strings! Who would do a thing like that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's not fair! I wanted to be a torban player when I grew up! I've been practising since I was tiny, but now I'll never get my big chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yay! The torbans have all been fixed! Now I can get practising again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I'm going to be the greatest torban player who ever lived, and then Lala will fall in love with me and marry me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, when they first suggested that they sing the torban parts while I danced, I thought they'd lost their minds, but it's actually not so bad!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can still feel the rhythm of the music flowing through me, even if it's not quite the real thing. It's like my feet have a mind of their own...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dancing to the air torban wasn't as bad as all that, but there's nothing quite like the real thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I feel like I am at one with the melody and rhythm of the instruments\f1\emdash\f0 truly, it's like my feet have a mind of their own!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
