\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the most sacred ceremony of the Roamer people, where the music of the torban and the rhythm of our dancers intertwine to form a prayer to the Almighty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Well, that's the idea, anyway. But some terrible individual sliced through all our torban strings, and now we're reduced to pretending to play.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's not the most dignified display, but what choice do we have? Now sit back and enjoy the world's first air torban concert! Ja-ja-JANNN! <LM_.|>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the most sacred ceremony of the Roamer people, where the music of the torban and the rhythm of our dancers intertwine to form a prayer to the Almighty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What do you make of my performance? I'm rather good, if I may say so. And with these new strings, I'm even better than ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have spent our lives listening to the sound of the torban. Now, even without it, I can still somehow feel its melodies and rhythms reverberating within me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, if I had a little dram of our sacred drink, the water of life we call the Spirit of the Dance, I am sure I could dance up a storm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please stay awhile and enjoy our marvellous music!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're lucky, we'll get you a dram of the Spirit of the Dance, our most sacred drink. It's quite something, I can assure you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If it were just regular torban strings that had been cut, we could find a way to repair them. But the Torban of Truth is a different matter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a sacred instrument that has been handed down through the generations, and is the only torban that can be used to awaken the Almighty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I remember well the young adventurer who restored it to our people. And now, after all the effort he went to, some vandal has gone and cut the strings! It's unthinkable!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Am I right in thinking it was you who brought us the golden mane? If so, we are eternally grateful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First there was that nice young man who came to our village, and now there's you. Young people today are a credit to their parents, they really are.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Neeeigh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
