\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Oh, there you are! I'm so happy to see you! Well, how did you get on?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Give the golden mane to Lala?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell ...Oh. No mane, you say? Without it, we will never be able to repair the Torban of Truth. And hard as we might try, we can never match its dulcet tones with our voices alone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Well, I am willing to wait. If you ever do manage to get hold of one, please bring it to me. I will be praying for your success.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Oh, you have it! That is wonderful! Let me look at it... Oh, it's so beautiful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell Now we will be able to repair the Torban of Truth! Thank you so much! Truly, you have helped us in our hour of need!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lala\cell On behalf of all my people, I would like to offer you a small token of our gratitude. Here, take this. You have earned it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
