\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure there's some divil in the depths o' the mine that's behind all this bother. Give 'em a wallopin' an' ye'll set everytin' right, sure as sure can be.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not exactly sure o' the details, y'understand. It happened all of a sudden, like. Ye'd be best to go an' see what's occurrin' with yer own eyes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that, ye say? Join ye!? Are ye daft\f1\emdash\f0 !? I mean, ehh... I, I'll stay here an' pray for ye! That'll do ye the world o' good! Best o' luck, now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There y'are! Ye made it back in one piece! An' it looks like ye taught whatever divil was doin' this the error of its ways!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, whatever ye did, it seems to have worked. Them awful bomb things have changed back into rainbow rocks. Ye saved the day, so ye did! Here, take this. Ye've earned it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the only place in the world ye'll find green gems. No matter what's ailin' ye, the little beauties'll have ye fixed up in no time flat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Minin' 'em's our bread an' butter, ye know. When those rockbombs appeared, I was sure it was curtains for all of us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks a million! We'll never forget what ye did for us! Sure, ye're a hero, so y'are! Now, mind how ye go!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the only place in the world ye'll find green gems. No matter what's ailin' ye, the little beauties'll have ye fixed up in no time flat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Minin' 'em's our bread an' butter, ye know. When those rockbombs appeared, I was sure it was curtains for all of us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that ye say? The monsters' boss was a warrior maiden wearin' pink armour? Well, I never!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can't say I've ever seen someone fittin' that description round these parts...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that I'm doubtin' ye, like. If ye say ye've seen a warrior maiden wearin' pink armour, that's good enough fer me. Well, here's hopin' she'll sort herself out an' won't cause this kind o' bother again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If ye're thinkin' of headin' in there, keep yer wits about ye. There's many who go in, but not so many who make it out...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure, this chap with a shock o' blonde hair is just after goin' in there with a determined look on his face.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He said sometin' about lookin' fer a green gem, but it's been a fair while now. I can't help worryin' that sometin' untoward has happened.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure, I just saw that chap with the shock o' blonde hair skippin' out o' here lookin' like the cat who'd got the cream! I'm not sure what he's so pleased about, but I'm happy fer the lad nonetheless!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahem! Sorry, just a stray bit of catarrh! Now, welcome to Chateau Felix, residence of the great sabrecat father, Master Felix!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sadly, he's out at the moment, but if you'd like to see some of the world's finest felines, feel free to have a stroll around the grounds!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell I've lived among cats for a long time, and I'm convinced that none of them are really bad deep down.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell That great sabrecat who's been terrorising us of late just needs to be tamed, I'm sure of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell That's why I want you to bring me something that might soothe his savage temper and get him purring like a kitten.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell I'm pretty sure he growled someone's name as he slinked off. ...<LM_6>Bianca<LM_9>, was it...? Maybe that will help you somehow?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell I've got a feeling that our friend the great sabrecat has managed to return home. And it's all thanks to you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Anyway, for a change of pace, how would you like to take a personality test that's been handed down through the generations here at Chateau Felix?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Oh well! Catch you later, then!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Great, then let's get started! You've just received your first pet great sabrecat\f1\emdash\f0 do you think Purrcy would make a good name?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell AHEM!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Now for question number two! A doddery old sabrecat comes up to you looking to join your party. Would you let him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell AHEM!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Now it's time for my third and final question! If you were to keep a great sabrecat as a pet, you wouldn't be able to relax for a second. You'd always need to stay alert. Would you be happy with that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Ahem! And here are the results!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as footloose and fancy-free as a dark sabrecat! You don't take a lot of interest in what's going on around you, and are a firm believer that if it ain't broke, it doesn't need fixing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as indolent as a weary weartiger at the end of a long day. But don't you think it's time to stop making excuses and maybe do something with your life?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as cheeky and cheerful as a cheater cheetah. You want an easy life, and prefer to put off difficult decisions. Just remember that sometimes hard choices need to be made.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as shrewd and savvy as a silver sabrecat. You always weigh up the merits of any situation before acting, but maybe you could try being a bit more impulsive sometimes?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as needy as a silver sabrecub. You find people hard work sometimes, but you really hate being left alone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as gawky and gauche as a great sabrecub. You have ideals you try to live by, but you're so impractical that things never seem to go the way you want them to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as wilful and uncompromising as a dark sabrecub. You think of yourself as upstanding and honest, but sometimes you need to put other people's feelings above your integrity.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell You are as mighty and magnificent as a great sabrecat. You are kind, strong and brave...or at least, you will be one day...right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell ...That's what the test says, anyway. Sound much like you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
