\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Ahem! Welcome to Chateau Felix! To be honest, I'm still reeling from the shock of seeing Jessica in tears.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Tom\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Tom\cell Yes, that's the Jessica we know and love alright! I'm just happy she's back to her old self.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Meeeow!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (purr)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (yawn)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Meeeow!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Dear me, what in the world has got into Jessica? She's being a model daughter\f1\emdash\f0 obedient, pleasant, respectful. It's most disconcerting!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell The Jessica I know is wilful, argumentative and utterly incapable of doing what she's told! I tried to stop her setting out on her little adventure, but she insisted on avenging her brother's death.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell And now she's some mild-mannered do-gooder all of a sudden? It's odd in the extreme. In fact, it's downright upsetting! How can I get my daughter back?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell ...Wait! I'm reminded of something a certain travelling salesman once told me\f1\emdash\f0 he said that there were books capable of changing the personality of anyone who read them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell I'm sure you visit all sorts of places on your travels. If you happened to find a book that might give me back the daughter I know, I could reward you handsomely. Would you do that for me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell ...Oh, I am sorry to hear that. I took you for an agreeable sort, but it seems you have little time for other people's concerns. Oh well, good luck with whatever vitally important business you're about!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Wonderful! I could tell you weren't the type to abandon others in their hour of need. Now, as mentioned, when she's herself, my daughter is energetic, strong-willed and very active indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell If you could find a tome that might turn her back into that sort of person, I would be eternally grateful. The salesman I spoke to mentioned the kingdom of Aliahan. Perhaps you might look there?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell What in the world can have got into her? My daughter is really not the type to burst into tears and demand her mother!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell She never listens to a word I say, but whatever her faults, she has always been independent, strong-headed and full of vim and vigour\f1\emdash\f0 that's the Jessica I know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell A certain travelling salesman once told me that there were books capable of changing the personalities of those who read them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell He said there were a number of them dotted around the place, and that one of them might be in the kingdom of Aliahan. Please, you must do all you can to find it and give me back the daughter I know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Ah! I spy an improving-looking volume in your hands! Might you have found the book that will give me back the daughter I know and occasionally love?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Wonderful! Umm...and what might the title be, pray tell?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell <LM_6>The Champion's Code<LM_9>, you say? Well, shall we get Jessica to read it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Hmm...you really think a book entitled <LM_6>Look, No Pants!<LM_9> will bring back the old Jessica?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Goodness me! You expect me to believe that a publication entitled <LM_6>Guns 'n' Buns<LM_9> will give me back my daughter!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell <LM_6>The Girl's Own Annual<LM_9>? Interesting. Shall we get Jessica to read it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Oh, come now\f1\emdash\f0 surely you cannot bear to part with such a timeless classic?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell No, that simply won't do! No matter how much I wish to return Jessica to her senses, I cannot allow her to deprive you of it. Shall we pick something else for her to read?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell My daughter is a spirited girl who knows what she wants and how to get it. If you could find a book that would return her to her true self, I would be eternally grateful.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell Hmm... Well, she certainly is a champion of sorts... Yes, let's have her take a look, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Rosalind has Jessica read <LM_6>The Champion's Code<LM_9>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell So...how are you feeling, dear?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jessica\cell Cor blimey! Mum! Wotchoo doin' 'ere, eh? If yer worried about me avengin' Alistair, don't be\f1\emdash\f0 I'm all set to chop 'ooever got 'im clean in two wiv me axe!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jessica\cell Oo's this bloke you've brought wiv you, anyway? 'E don't look like much. An' wot's 'e got 'is 'air parted like Angelo's for? Don't 'e know not to take fashion tips off that lemon?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rosalind\cell .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
