\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Well, I'm going to spend a little more time with her and then head home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
