\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Jessica\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jessica\cell ...Oh! Where did this handsome young man come from? You're lovely, aren't you? Tell me...have you ever had a puff-puff before?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not used to my mother being this nice. It's...unnerving...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's very strange. Apparently, Jessica was happily adventuring with her companions when she suddenly started missing her mother so much that she burst into tears!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When we heard, her mother and I hurried here to see if she was alright.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Underneath it all, Jessica and her mother care about each other very much. It's just a shame they spend all their time at each other's throats.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But something's changed, I can tell. They still don't see eye to eye about a lot of things, but now you can see that there's real affection there too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait, let me guess\f1\emdash\f0 you have come to add to the chorus of complaints, correct?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmph. Well, that is no surprise. But truly, I have no idea why I have been forced to bear the brunt of so much dissatisfaction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I shared that map, this place was veritably crawling with metal king slimes. I wonder what can have changed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Really? Well, I suppose that makes sense\f1\emdash\f0 you do not seem to be in possession of a treasure map, after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Treasure maps are curious things indeed. All one has to do is to possess one, and a grotto will appear. They are highly sought-after items, and adventurers like to swap them with one another.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, the very grotto where we stand was one I opened with the aid of a treasure map.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first, I could not believe my luck\f1\emdash\f0 it was positively swarming with metal king slimes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, as you can imagine, I was very proud of myself indeed, and promptly shared the map in a place where plenty of adventurers were bound to see it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Imagine my surprise when a few days later, all manner of irate strangers who had made use of my discovery sought me out and heaped abuse on me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: <LM_6>What did you think you were doing, sharing a map like that!? Do you have no respect for your fellow adventurer!?<LM_9>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They said the most hurtful things, but the truth is that I have no idea what they were upset about, for I have been unable to reach the depths of the grotto to discover the source of their disgruntlement.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All of which brings me to the boon I wished to ask of you\f1\emdash\f0 would you do me the great favour of plunging in and finding out what the problem is?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am sorry to hear that. Well, if you change your mind, do let me know. In truth, I have no other friends to ask...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will!? Oh, that is truly a relief! I have no companions left who can be relied on to accompany me. I am glad indeed that you are able to go in my stead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I explored it myself, the grotto did not reveal anything strange or startling beyond the abundance of metal king slimes I mentioned.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But there must be something in its darkest depths to cause such widespread dissatisfaction. I must know what it is\f1\emdash\f0 and for that I will need your help! I wish you the very best of luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It was I who found the treasure map that opened this grotto. It was quite a find\f1\emdash\f0 the rarest of the rare.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first, I really thought I'd struck gold. I've never heard of a grotto with such an abundance of metal king slimes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it seems there is more to this place than meets the eye. All the adventurers I have since shared the map with have showered me with nothing but abuse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot imagine why. The parts of the grotto I have explored revealed nothing strange or startling beyond the metal king slimes I mentioned.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But there must be something in its deepest depths to cause such widespread upset. I must know what it is\f1\emdash\f0 and for that, I will have to rely on you! I wish you the very best of luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, there you are! So, did you discover why all of those adventurers were so angry with me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh. That is rather disappointing. Well, I hate to be demanding, but perhaps you would be kind enough to plunge back into the depths of the grotto and find out what has been going on down there?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Goodness! Some metal king slimes had fused together, and were intent on taking revenge on all the adventurers who have ever persecuted their kind for experience-farming purposes!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No wonder everyone I shared that map with ended up hating me so ferociously!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Metal king slimes have always been the most eagerly sought-after of monsters. To think they would resent the attention and seek their revenge!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I had always imagined that these noble creatures and those who hunted them enjoyed a healthy mutual respect.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How could they not? In slaughtering them, we hone our skills, and in fleeing our flying swords, they eliminate their slower brethren! A symbiotic relationship if ever I encountered one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But enough of my musings\f1\emdash\f0 hopefully the grotto is back to normal thanks to your efforts, and can return to being an abundant source of sprightly, grudge-free metal king slimes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I am free to share my treasure map with the world once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only hope that it one day falls into the hands of a true hero\f1\emdash\f0 a mighty warrior who will save the world. Well, one can dream, can one not?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I am free to share my treasure map with the world once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only hope that it one day falls into the hands of a true hero\f1\emdash\f0 a mighty warrior who will save the world. Well, one can dream, can one not?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In the meantime, I will seek out ever greater maps, that adventurers all over the world might one day sing my name!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But in future, perhaps I will quietly slip them into drawers and bookshelves, so that only the wiliest of wanderers will find them. Ahh, what fun this all is!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erinn\cell (sigh)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erinn\cell (sigh) I'm no innkeeper... I'm just some talentless girl who happened to be born to a one-time Inncredible Inntertainer...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erinn\cell How did I ever manage to win an Inny...? The judges must have made a mistake... I'm not cut out for this... I think it might be time to get out of the innkeeping business once and for all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erinn\cell I lost sight of what was most important\f1\emdash\f0 my guests. If I'm not smiling, neither are they.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell What good are awards and accolades if you forget something as simple as that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erinn\cell But I won't forget again. I'm going to keep smiling, take pride in my work, and make every single customer who walks through the door feel special!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Patty\cell Welcome to Patty's Party Planning Place, where adventurers seeking like-minded souls meet, mingle and make merry!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Patty\cell ...Hey, I know we just met and all, but I feel like I can trust you. I was wondering if you'd mind me bending your ear about something that's been on my mind. Step around to this side of the counter, will you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Patty\cell Welcome to Patty's Party Planning Place, where adventurers seeking like-minded souls meet, mingle and make merry!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
