\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmph. I'm very underwhelmed, I must admit. I heard this place had won an Inny, so I was looking forward to enjoying some truly top-hole hospitality, but the innkeeper has a face like a wet weekend...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder what the matter with the innkeeper was... Well, whatever it was, she's over it now. She went from looking like a wet weekend to a ray of sunshine just like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry about that bodura grass I gave you. I really had no use for it. I'm just happy I was able to help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What is that you say? You are looking for a prince?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, I know who it is you seek! But I am afraid you are out of luck. He set out on a journey, and will not be back for quite some time, I fear.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What is that you say? You are looking for a prince?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, I know who it is you seek! You are in luck. He is here, no doubt with his beloved Lala.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry about being so naughty. (slurp) I'm not a bad slime, I promise!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I wanted was to be a terrifying dragon and make people quiver like jellies...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's been my dream since I was just a speck of goo\f1\emdash\f0 I wanted to be huge, and have big flappy wings and scales and a horn and three tails and, and...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then I found that fygg, and I wanted to make my dreams come true much, and...well, then all this happened... (slurp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I... I don't oozually act like this, honestly... (slurp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, before it slips my mind, be careful if you're gooing any deeper into the grotto\f1\emdash\f0 I've got a feeling there's something seriously scary in there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell Curious, most curious... How could a fygg just vanish like that...? This is most vexing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell ...Oh! Forgive my surprise. We do not see many mortals here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell And mortals should not see us at all... We Celestrians are invisible to humankind... Is this...a dream...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell No matter\f1\emdash\f0 it is what it is. What business do you have here, child of man?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Ask Aquila what he was worrying about before?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell You journey to a sacred place few mortals have ever seen, yet have no reason for doing so? You are a strange one indeed. I would ask that you leave\f1\emdash\f0 I have bigger concerns than entertaining guests.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell Hm? You wish to aid me in my plight? Ha! You mock me, of course.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Nevertheless, I suppose I have nothing to lose in telling you\f1\emdash\f0 I have managed to misplace one of the sacred golden fruits known as fyggs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell Upon focusing my mind on its whereabouts, these mysterious words came to me...<LM_6>Ruby Path of Doom<LM_9>...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell A paltry clue, I am more than aware, but if you truly wish to aid me, perhaps you might investigate its meaning and seek out the fruit? I will reward you generously, of course.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell It is my sacred duty to guard the golden fruits known as fyggs. They are our most precious treasures. Imagine my alarm when one simply vanished into thin air.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I have no idea what happened, but naturally I take full responsibility for the disappearance. You would be doing me an enormous service by seeking it out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell Upon focusing my mind on its whereabouts, these mysterious words came to me...<LM_6>Ruby Path of Doom<LM_9>...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell A paltry clue, I am more than aware, but it is all I can offer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I sense a great power... You have found it, have you not? The fygg?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell Hand the fygg to Aquila?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell ...Oh. I see. I was certain I could sense the benevolent aura of that sacred fruit, but...I suppose I must have been mistaken.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell This is it! Thank you, friend!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I never thought I would see the day when a mortal came to my aid, but I am truly grateful. Please, do me the honour of accepting this token of my gratitude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell ...Is that so? The fygg fell from the Observatory to the ground below only to be discovered by a slime with dreams of being a dragon? Dear me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell This is precisely why we keep such a careful watch over the sacred fruits\f1\emdash\f0 to prevent them from falling into the wrong hands.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I still do not understand how it happened. I was holding it, then it was...gone in the blink of an eye. How could I have prevented that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I sense that an evil power was behind this. A power far surpassing my own meagre abilities. I urge you to take care on your travels\f1\emdash\f0 there are dark forces abroad.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell Fyggs possess the mysterious power to make the dreams of those who consume them come true.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell It is to prevent them from falling into the hands of the monstrous and malign that we guard them so carefully. But the one we lost simply vanished in the blink of an eye...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell I sense that an evil power was behind this. A power far surpassing my own meagre abilities. I urge you to take care on your travels\f1\emdash\f0 there are dark forces abroad.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Aquila\cell There is something in your bearing and benevolent air that reminds me of a former young charge of mine\f1\emdash\f0 the Guardian of a place called Angel Falls. I hope that my former pupil is well...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Extraordinary! For a mortal to reach this place is no mean feat. Clearly there is more to you than meets the eye\f1\emdash\f0 you can see me, for one thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Strange things are afoot, it seems... But perhaps you are here to offer succour in these troubled times. My brother Aquila would seem to be in need of some assistance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell But forgive me\f1\emdash\f0 you clearly have business of some kind. ...Hm? Defuddle drops?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Why, of course I know of them! And how remarkably helpful they are! Monsters are, after all, wont to baffle and disorient those who face them in battle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell We Celestrians all carry them when we are abroad, that we might aid those afflicted in this manner. But why do you ask?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> explains what's been going on in Aliahan...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell So you have journeyed here in search of a cure? By your description of the symptoms, it does indeed seem that Defuddle drops might be the answer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Please, take this. It should be more than enough to cure the people of the town you speak of.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives some Defuddle drops. Take them to Aliahan and bring everybody back to their senses!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Fyggs are extraordinary fruit indeed. They possess the power to make the dreams of any who eat them come true. Should one fall into the wrong hands, there could be truly terrible consequences.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell I do not know if you are aware, but a fearsome dragon is rumoured to have appeared in a certain cave down on the surface.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell And at just the same time that Aquila lost his precious fygg. Coincidence? I somehow doubt it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Ah, so you found the fygg? That is good news indeed. You had best return it to Aquila without delay. I know he is very anxious to recover it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell The gratitude and goodwill of mortalkind form crystals of a substance known as benevolessence. The World Tree absorbs these crystals, giving rise to the golden fruits known as fyggs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell My people\f1\emdash\f0 the Celestrians\f1\emdash\f0 are charged with the sacred duty of gathering the crystals and offering them up to mighty Yggdrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell If you had not found that fygg, decades of patient benevolessence-harvesting would have been for naught. We are truly grateful for all you have done.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We come from a village named Tenton. It is a place situated on a remote island where we have been free to live our lives in peace until now. But then everything changed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One day, without the slightest warning, a horde of monsters descended upon the village and burned it to the ground. We both lost our lives in the carnage, along with many of our kith and kin...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As they were wrenched from our bodies, our spirits heard a voice from above. It told us that we had a destiny to fulfil, and that we were to be reborn as members of one of the five tribes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The same voice led us here, and then suddenly was gone. It was then that a fiend appeared, and announced himself as <LM_6>the Revivalist<LM_9>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He told us that he would not permit us to be reborn from one of the five tribes, but that we must instead take the form of monsters. As you might imagine, this was none too tempting an offer...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thus, we find ourselves stuck. To rid this room of the monsters who occupy it, the Revivalist must be hunted down and defeated. But in our current form, this feat is beyond us. Please, will you come to our aid?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...B-But we have no hope without you! Are we to remain stuck here forever!? Is that to be our fate!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you so much! Now, as to the whereabouts of the fiend, before vanishing, he declared that he was determined to find an instrument called the Lyre of Ire.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As to his appearance, he takes the form of an old man. Should you find such a figure acting suspiciously on the trail of the Lyre, the chances are that you have found your man.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All we can do is wish you the very best of luck. Please, we beg of you\f1\emdash\f0 find him and defeat him! Only then will we be able to be reborn and fulfil our destiny!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We were led here by a voice from above. It told us that we had a destiny to fulfil, and that we were to be reborn as members of one of the five tribes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then suddenly the voice was gone, and a fiend appeared and announced himself as <LM_6>the Revivalist<LM_9>. He told us that we would not be reborn from one of the five tribes, but must instead become monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which was none too tempting an offer, as you can imagine. Please, find him and defeat him. Before he vanished he said he was determined to find an instrument called the Lyre of Ire.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As to his appearance, he takes the form of an old man. Should you find such a figure acting suspiciously on the trail of the Lyre, the chances are that you have found your man.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The monsters are gone! You did it, did you not? You defeated the Revivalist!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally, we can be reborn as members of one of the five tribes, and set out to discover what our destiny might be! New lives stretch before us, and we owe it all to you! Please, take this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As to where life will take us from here, that I cannot say. Nor do I know why our village was attacked. I have countless questions, but few answers...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if a higher power has granted us another chance at life, we must live it to the fullest, for the sake of our kith and kin who lost theirs. And whatever our destiny proves to be, we will grab it with both hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally, we can be reborn as members of one of the five tribes, and set out to discover what our destiny might be! New lives stretch before us, and we owe it all to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As to where life will take us from here, that I cannot say. Nor do I know why our village was attacked. I have countless questions, but few answers...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if a higher power has granted us another chance at life, we must live it to the fullest, for the sake of our kith and kin who lost theirs. And whatever our destiny proves to be, we will grab it with both hands!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you see the five statues over there? They represent the five tribes, one of which we are to choose as the form in which to be reborn.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Beginning with the one next to me, they are, in order, a wetling, a dwarf, an elf, a poppet and an ogre.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My plan was to be reborn as an ogre, the most powerful of the tribes\f1\emdash\f0 at least in terms of brute strength. But I do not want to be a troll at all! That is different altogether!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At long last, our true quest can begin. What lies ahead, I do not know. I have lost friends and family, and in truth, I am afraid...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But of one thing I am certain\f1\emdash\f0 I will never forgive those black-hearted beasts for what they did...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lump Mage\cell Hur hur hurrr! Alright, mate? You want to be a lump mage like me, do ya?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Lump Mage\cell Oo'd want to be a stupid elf anyway? Nah, bein' a lump mage is the best! If you meet anyone ya don't like the look of, you can just put an 'orrible curse on 'em! Hur hur hurrr!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Grublin\cell Grubba dubba! Fancy bein' a grublin, do ya?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Grublin\cell It's better than bein' a borin' ol' dwarf, that I guarantee! Grublins fight hard and they play hard! Grubba dubba doo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Merman\cell Want to really make a splash? Be a merman!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Merman\cell I don't sea the point of being a wetling. We're way better looking\f1\emdash\f0 and they don't even have tails!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kisser\cell Mmmm-MWAH! Kiss your old life goodbye and be reborn as a kisser!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Kisser\cell Come on, what are you waiting for? With a sweet set of lips like yours, you'd be a natural! Pucker up! Mmmm-MWAH!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Troll\cell GUR HUR HUR! TROLL GOOD! BE TROLL! TROLL BEST!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Troll\cell OGRE RUBBISH. OGRE WEAK. TROLL STRONGER. BETTER. SMASH ALL WITH CLUB! FUN! GUR HUR HUR!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Extraordinary! For a mortal to reach this place is no mean feat. Clearly there is more to you than meets the eye\f1\emdash\f0 you can see me, for one thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Strange things are afoot, it seems... But perhaps you are here to offer succour in these troubled times. My brother Aquila would seem to be in need of some assistance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell But forgive me\f1\emdash\f0 you clearly have business of some kind. ...Hm? Defuddle drops?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Why, of course I know of them! And how remarkably helpful they are! Monsters are, after all, wont to baffle and disorient those who face them in battle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell We Celestrians all carry them when we are abroad, that we might aid those afflicted in this manner. But why do you ask?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> explains what's been going on in Aliahan...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell So you have journeyed here in search of a cure? By your description of the symptoms, it does indeed seem that Defuddle drops might be the answer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Please, take this. It should be more than enough to cure the people of the town you speak of.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives some Defuddle drops. Take them to Aliahan and bring everybody back to their senses!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Fyggs are extraordinary fruit indeed. They possess the power to make the dreams of any who eat them come true. Should one fall into the wrong hands, there could be truly terrible consequences.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell I do not know if you are aware, but a fearsome dragon is rumoured to have appeared in a certain cave down on the surface.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell And at just the same time that Aquila lost his precious fygg. Coincidence? I somehow doubt it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell Ah, so you found the fygg? That is good news indeed. You had best return it to Aquila without delay. I know he is very anxious to recover it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell The gratitude and goodwill of mortalkind form crystals of a substance known as benevolessence. The World Tree absorbs these crystals, giving rise to the golden fruits known as fyggs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell My people\f1\emdash\f0 the Celestrians\f1\emdash\f0 are charged with the sacred duty of gathering the crystals and offering them up to mighty Yggdrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Pavo\cell If you had not found that fygg, decades of patient benevolessence-harvesting would have been for naught. We are truly grateful for all you have done.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell The Galapagod wears a benign expression as it watches over the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you have come. You are <pc>, are you not? And you have come to restore the Shelled One? I bid you welcome.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do not be surprised\f1\emdash\f0 Tenda foresaw it all. She predicted that the troubles roiling another world would bring monsters, that they would carry off the Galapagod and that you would be our saviour.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allow me to explain. The Galapagod is a giant tortoise that watches over our village. He sends His thoughts to Tenda, blessed as she is with acute psychic powers, and she uses His instructions to guide us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The thought of monsters manhandling the Shelled One pained me terribly, but Tenda told me that I should not resist, and should instead wait for the coming of the one called <pc>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your destiny is to restore the Galapagod to His rightful place, as has been foretold. Will you travel between worlds, defeat the monsters in the castle of the Necrogond and return our sacred guide to us?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.<LM_LF>Will you acquiesce to this request?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... You have refused, just as the Shelled One said you would...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He said you would refuse at first, but that in the end you would come to our aid. I have absolute faith in His words, and shall calmly await your change of heart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, what a relief! ...I was not worried, of course. I knew you would agree\f1\emdash\f0 the Shelled One is never wrong, after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, while I cannot join you on your quest, I will aid you in whatever way I can. Firstly, please take this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives the Zoomstone!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: With this stone, you will always be able to return to Tenton, even all the way from another world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you find the Shelled One, use the Zoomstone, and both of you will be whisked back here in a flash. I know you can do it, <pc>, for it is your destiny.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tenda foresaw it all. She predicted that the troubles roiling another world would bring monsters, that they would carry off the Galapagod and that you would be our saviour.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your destiny is to travel between worlds, defeat the monsters at the castle in the Necrogond and restore the Galapagod to its rightful place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has been foretold that the Shelled One will be restored to us, but still I am nervous. If he were to come to any harm, it could have unthinkable consequences!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you find the Galapagod, use the Zoomstone and both of you will be whisked back here in a flash. I know you can do it, <pc>!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And so it has come to pass, just as it was foretold. You have our undying gratitude. And that is not all\f1\emdash\f0 our leader, Tenda, wanted you to have this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before this misfortune befell us, the Shelled One had not left our village for a thousand years or more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every second without him was pure agony. Though I believed that he would be returned to us, I was beset by worry. It is good that the other villagers were spared all of this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are fortunate to have a leader as wise as Tenda. It was she who led the people of the village to safety.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In truth, I do not know why all of this has happened, but there is one thing I am sure of\f1\emdash\f0 Tenda is wise and noble, and I will do all I can to serve and assist her. We all have our role in life, and that is mine.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before this misfortune befell us, the Shelled One had not left our village for a thousand years or more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every second without him was pure agony. Though I believed that he would be returned to us, I was beset by worry. It is good that the other villagers were spared all of this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is just fortunate that we have a leader as wise as Tenda. It was she who led the people of the village to safety.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In truth, I do not know why all of this has happened, but there is one thing I am sure of\f1\emdash\f0 Tenda is wise and noble, and I will do all I can to serve and assist her. We all have our role in life, and that is mine.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We lived in peaceful seclusion for so long. Our village was protected by the blessings of the Shelled One, and hidden from monsters by Tenda's sorcery.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that peace was not destined to last. Tenda foresaw that one day monsters would come, and that the Shelled One would be taken from us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I heard this, I was naturally thrown into a terrible panic. But Tenda remained calm, and led the villagers to safety before the monsters came. She is young, but she is far wiser than me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now the important thing is to restore the Shelled One to His rightful place before everyone returns to the village. Oh, how I pray that He comes home to us unharmed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone is on the way home, and they shall remain blissfully unaware of all that has happened in their absence. For them, it was all just a jolly excursion.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And all is thanks to you. Without your courage and dedication, the heart would have been torn from the village. But now everyone can return to their lives. Thank you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our poor village! I wandered away from Tenda and the others and found myself back here, you see. Now I am reeling from the shock!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But wait! Who are you? ...Hm? You say you are the one whose coming was foretold by Tenda?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, whoever you are, we need your help! Start by making sure you have spoken to everyone here! Come on! Hurry!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would not expect you to understand, but the Shelled One means the world to us. Without him, we are nothing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If he were to come to any harm, it would be the end\f1\emdash\f0 there is nothing surer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you have to help him! Return the Shelled One to us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh thank you, thank you, thank you! You have restored the Shelled One to his rightful place!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know that the gooreat big tree at the centre of the Observatory is called Yggdrasil?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And the people gooing about the place with great big wings are called Celestrians. Their job is to collect something called benevolessence from goomans like you and offer it up to the tree.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
