\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Whatever trials and tribulations lie ahead, don't forget that this is your destiny, this is who you are. You're the Luminary, the Chosen One, and your purpose in life is to save the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell However rough things get, I know you won't give up. If you keep moving forward, the road will open up before you. I have faith in you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1722\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell So go and do it, <pc>! Go and batter the Lord of Shadows and then come home to Cobblestone. We'll be waiting for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
